.SH EXAMPLES
.SS Building a WarpShip
.nf
> build new W2 Destroyer
> build set pd=5 b=3 s=2 t=1 m=3
> build commit
.fi
.PP
Total cost: 5+3+2+1+1+5(WG) = 17 BP
.br
Tech level 0 (if built turns 1-4)

.SS Building a SystemShip Fighter
.nf
> build new S55 Fighter
> build set pd=1 t=1 m=6
> build commit
.fi
.PP
Total cost: 1+1+2 = 4 BP
.br
No Warp Generator (SystemShip)

.SS Movement Example
.nf
> move W6 Girsu Kish
.fi
.PP
W6 moves from current hex to Girsu (1 PD), along warpline to next star (1 PD), then 3 hexes to Kish (3 PD) = 5 PD total

.SS Combat Order Example
.nf
> combat order W3 attack S25 d=0 b=3 s=2
.fi
.PP
W3 attacks S25, allocating 0 to drive, 3 to beam, 2 to screen (requires PD≥5)

.SS Missile Fire Example
.nf
> combat order S25 dodge W3 d=4 t=1 m=1
> (missile drive setting: 3)
.fi
.PP
S25 dodges while firing 1 missile at W3 with drive=3 (requires PD≥5)

.SH CONSTRAINTS AND INVARIANTS
.IP \(bu 2
No randomness - all outcomes deterministic
.IP \(bu 2
No hidden information - all game state is public
.IP \(bu 2
Rules do not change mid-game
.IP \(bu 2
Equal inputs yield equal outcomes
.IP \(bu 2
Ships retain original tech level permanently
.IP \(bu 2
Warp Generators never take damage (ship destroyed when all else is 0)
.IP \(bu 2
SystemShips cannot have Warp Generators or SystemShip Racks
.IP \(bu 2
WarpShips cannot be carried in SystemShip Racks

.SH REPAIR AND RESUPPLY
.IP \(bu 2
Ship must start turn at your base star hex
.IP \(bu 2
SystemShips can be repaired/resupplied while loaded on WarpShip
.IP \(bu 2
1 BP repairs 1 unit of any attribute
.IP \(bu 2
Cannot repair beyond original built capacity
.IP \(bu 2
Tech level never changes
.IP \(bu 2
1 BP resupplies up to 3 missiles
.IP \(bu 2
Cannot resupply beyond original missile capacity

.SH SYSTEMSHIP PICKUP/DROP
.SS During Movement
.IP \(bu 2
Costs 1 PD per SystemShip picked up or dropped
.IP \(bu 2
Can be done at any star hex during movement

.SS During Combat
.IP \(bu 2
Requires: Drive=0, Screen=0, Dodge or Retreat tactic
.IP \(bu 2
Only 1 SystemShip per combat round
.IP \(bu 2
May fire Beam (but not Missiles) while picking up/dropping
.IP \(bu 2
Dropped SystemShips cannot fire that round
.IP \(bu 2
Picked up SystemShips cannot fire but may power Screens

.SS After Combat
.IP \(bu 2
Free rearrangement of SystemShips at star hexes
.IP \(bu 2
No movement cost
.IP \(bu 2
Active player only

