.SH GAME DESIGN PHILOSOPHY
Kepler's Horizon is intentionally minimal. Strategic depth emerges from:
.IP \(bu 2
Constrained movement
.IP \(bu 2
Simultaneous decision-making
.IP \(bu 2
Irreversible consequences
.PP
The rules favor clarity over complexity.
